   "title": "Apple Foldable Phone Patents - Insights;Gate",
   "url": "https://insights.greyb.com/apple-foldable-phone-patents/",
   "snippet": "Apple has filed 32 foldable phone patents globally, out of which 20 have been granted. Of these 32 patents, 90.625% of patents are active."
