  {
   "title": "Search for patents | USPTO",
   "url": "https://www.uspto.gov/patents/search",
   "snippet": "Find existing patents, published patent applications, and other published patent documentation."
  },
  {
   "title": "Apple's Hinge Patent Could Signal Major Advancements in Foldable Device ...",
   "url": "https://twoeva.com/2024/12/17/apple-hinge-patent-foldable-device-innovation/",
   "snippet": "Apple has been granted a new patent for an innovative hinge mechanism, marking a key development in its pursuit of foldable devices. This patent, numbered US 12,164,344, introduces an intricate hinge design featuring interconnected links and gears. These components enable a smooth folding action and provide the necessary friction to maintain the device at specific angles, preventing unwanted ..."
  },
  {
   "title": "Apple patents what could be the iPhone Fold's hinge",
   "url": "https://www.techadvisor.com/article/2553266/apple-patents-what-could-be-the-iphone-folds-hinge.html",
